  <name>BubbleFairy</name>
  <summary>Your iMessages on your Linux desktop, ferried over from your Mac</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.theteknocat"><name>Peter Epp</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>BubbleFairy brings Messages to your Linux desktop: conversations with photos, videos, links and files, live notifications with sound, and search across everything.</p>
    <p>It is a front end for Messages on your Mac, which still does the messaging. BubbleFairy connects to the Mac securely over your network.</p>
  </description>
